title: Start
---
<<declare $location = "Home">>
<<declare $hour = 8>>
<<declare $energy = 4>>
<<declare $coins = 0>>
<<declare $earned = 0>>
<<declare $shift_open = false>>
<<declare $status = "A free day.">>
<<checkpoint day.home>>
Morning at {$location}. Hour {$hour}, energy {$energy}, coins {$coins}. Your permit is packed.
-> Visit the market <<if $energy >= 2>>
    <<jump Market>>
-> Stay home and rest
    <<rest>>
    <<jump Evening>>
===
title: Market
---
<<checkpoint day.market>>
<<visit_market>>
At {$location}. Hour {$hour}, energy {$energy}. Morning shift open {$shift_open}. Schedule listed {state_map_contains_key("schedule", "market")}.
-> Work the morning shift <<if $shift_open and $energy >= 2 and state_list_contains("inventory", "permit")>>
    <<jump Shift>>
-> Return home
    <<jump Return>>
===
title: Shift
---
<<checkpoint day.shift>>
<<work_shift>>
{$status} Earned {$earned} coins. Hour {$hour}, energy {$energy}, coins {$coins}. Inventory entries {state_list_len("inventory")}.
-> Buy a snack for 2 coins <<if $coins >= 2>>
    <<buy_snack>>
    {$status} Coins {$coins}. Snack packed {state_list_contains("inventory", "snack")}.
    <<jump Return>>
-> Head home without shopping
    <<jump Return>>
===
title: Return
---
<<checkpoint day.return>>
<<return_home>>
At {$location}. Hour {$hour}, energy {$energy}, coins {$coins}.
-> Eat the snack <<if state_list_contains("inventory", "snack")>>
    <<eat_snack>>
    <<jump Evening>>
-> Rest
    <<rest>>
    <<jump Evening>>
===
title: Evening
---
<<checkpoint day.end>>
Day complete at {$location}. Hour {$hour}, energy {$energy}, coins {$coins}. {$status} Inventory entries {state_list_len("inventory")}.
===
